  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your connection to the essence of the natural world deepens.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Veilweaver level 7th, veil of nature class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Choose one veil from any list. This cannot be a Title, a veil that creates a manufactured weapon, or a veil that can only be shaped in a class-specific slot (such as Ring or Storm). That veil is added to your list of choices for your veil of nature class feature. Each time you gain a new level, you may change the veil this feat grants.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/huay#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
